{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":20090,\"title\":\"Nytt på nytt\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Nytt på nytt is a Norwegian version of the British comedy programme Have I Got News for You, by the production company Hat Trick Productions. The programme is aired weekly on Friday nights. The show is a competition between two panels, where one panelist is permanent, and the other is a guest. The goal is to solve several tasks. The element of competition is largely ignored in favour of the witty remarks and the banter between panelists. The scores are generally overlooked, and have only a brief mention at the end of the show. The host is Bård Tufte Johansen with permanent panelists Kristine Grændsen and Johan Golden. Grændsen replaced Isalill Simonsen Kolpus from the spring of 2026. Since the start in the spring of 1999, it has grown to become the most popular weekly show on Norwegian television, with more than a million viewers every week.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/flXTPa5WEWJ5aRBt78IrIiz87cD.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yAursiuwJv0zbU0sdjephjKTeEU.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":12,\"year\":1999,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":55,\"totalEpisodes\":810,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"NRK1\",\"NRK TV\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"NO\",\"name\":\"Norway\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-10-23\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":219530,\"name\":\"Bård Tufte Johansen\",\"character\":\"Programleder\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2ipKQyRc0KQoIJy2b6TE5RqJRzC.jpg\"},{\"id\":3142817,\"name\":\"Kristine Grændsen\",\"character\":\"Lagleder\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kBpqsXNkkuBzQ0IzMHBljYXrlIS.jpg\"},{\"id\":1247676,\"name\":\"Johan Golden\",\"character\":\"Lagleder\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mUaRdqzZ9JInGgk4JxLqFM8wgrt.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"j6iBG3Xr2EQ\",\"